OL,3,ARussian man accused of spying on US
OL,4,Atech defence company that assists
OL,5,AUkraine
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS investigators have arrested a
OL,8,FRussian man who they say was recruited
OL,9,Fby Moscow to spy on employees of a
OL,10,Ftechnology and defence firm in
OL,11,FCalifornia's Silicon Valley that has
OL,12,Flinks to Ukraine.
OL,14,FIgor D'iu is accused of acting as an
OL,15,Fagent of a foreign government to
OL,16,Fconduct a spying operation in Palo
OL,17,FAlto, near San Francisco.
OL,19,FHe is also accused of stalking
OL,20,Femployees of the company and possessing
OL,21,Ffalsified identity documents.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
