OL,3,ARussian man accused of spying on US
OL,4,Atech defence company that assists
OL,5,AUkraine
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe company is not named in charging
OL,8,Fdocuments, but is described as a
OL,9,Fpublicly traded technology and defence
OL,10,Fcompany that produces software used by
OL,11,FUkraine in its war with Russia. US
OL,12,Fprosecutors say the company was
OL,13,Ftargeted by Russia due to its
OL,14,Fassistance to Kyiv.
